"LinkBayCMS already finds and ranks your Quick Wins from Google Search "
"Console data — for free, on every plan. AI credits pay for going deeper "
"on a specific page or site: a plain-English explanation, a detailed "
"suggestion, or a step-by-step recovery plan. The AI never replaces the "
"data — it interprets what's already been measured."
